    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμ</span></b> , for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά,</span>
		before words beginning with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ</span>, e.g. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂμ βωμοῖσι,
			ἂμ μέσον, ἂμ πεδίον, ἂμ πέλαγος, ἂμ φυτά;</span> also
		compds., as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπαύω</span>:—mostly 
			Dor.
		, as in <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
		</span></i>, but also in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, sts. in Trag.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
